@startuml
autonumber
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
title S-03 Requirements analysis (analyst)

participant "harness\nprimary lead" as primary
participant "harness-analyst" as analyst
participant "local-rag\nFTS5 + LanceDB" as rag
participant "docs/analysis" as docs
participant "harness-orchestrator" as orch

primary -> analyst : task: requirements for the topic
analyst -> rag : rag_context / rag_search
rag --> analyst : pointers: file + lines
analyst -> analyst : Read and verify sources
alt data is sufficient
  analyst -> docs : requirements-*.md\nR-001.., NFR-1..
else gaps exist
  analyst -> docs : questions-*.md\nquestions + assumptions
end
analyst -> docs : glossary.md
analyst --> orch : requirements, questions, risks,\nartifact paths, blockers
note right of analyst
  Requirements are atomic
  and verifiable, with IDs R-NNN
end note
@enduml
